WEBVTT

00:00:00.478 --> 00:00:02.469
Do you know about Season Fairies?

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:06.641
They are fairies that make rain,
create winds, and produce clouds.

00:00:06.984 --> 00:00:10.215
They are little fairies in charge of
their own seasons.

00:00:10.354 --> 00:00:12.219
But, can you believe it?

00:00:12.356 --> 00:00:15.655
Such a little thing tumbled into my room,
of all places.

00:00:16.827 --> 00:00:18.419
Are you listening, Sugar?

00:00:18.662 --> 00:00:21.130
Huh? What is it, Saga? Please say it again.

00:00:21.198 --> 00:00:22.165
As always...

00:00:23.234 --> 00:00:26.101
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:29.239
Kuchibiru ni

00:00:29.473 --> 00:00:33.375
Namida no rouge

00:00:54.131 --> 00:00:57.066
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:57.935 --> 00:01:04.602
Ai nante, Shiritaku naiwa

00:01:08.846 --> 00:01:12.043
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:12.449 --> 00:01:14.474
Kuchibiru ni

00:01:14.985 --> 00:01:18.785
Namida no rouge

00:01:23.327 --> 00:01:26.785
Mokuyo ni

00:01:26.931 --> 00:01:29.559
Bara o kai

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:34.032
Tegami o soete

00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:40.510
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:41.312 --> 00:01:43.576
Yume de au

00:01:44.215 --> 00:01:49.209
Anata wa yasashii

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:24.978
A "Twinkle" is at school?

00:02:25.322 --> 00:02:28.392
Yes, I'm positive that's
what they are saying.

00:02:28.392 --> 00:02:29.518
Isn't that right?

00:02:31.128 --> 00:02:33.130
They are all friends and like to chat.

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:38.135
If you want to sunbathe, the best place is
Civic Hall. That's what they say.

00:02:38.135 --> 00:02:43.807
And, when it comes to meals, the waffles
here are the best, they say. And...

00:02:43.807 --> 00:02:47.607
We don't care about the gossip party
of the doves. What's more important is...

00:02:47.678 --> 00:02:50.010
Oh, silly me.

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:53.117
According to the doves, the other evening...

00:02:53.117 --> 00:02:57.076
they saw something very pretty at
the human school.

00:02:57.388 --> 00:02:58.355
Right?

00:03:00.291 --> 00:03:02.088
It must be the "Twinkle"!

00:03:03.127 --> 00:03:05.095
But, it's just a rumor, right?

00:03:05.296 --> 00:03:08.754
Anyway, unless we look for it,
nothing happens!

00:03:09.166 --> 00:03:10.394
Here! Waffo!

00:03:10.668 --> 00:03:11.635
Hey, Sugar!

00:03:13.103 --> 00:03:15.071
Hmm... She's very hasty.

00:03:28.485 --> 00:03:30.453
We have arrived at the school!

00:03:30.587 --> 00:03:33.249
- Somewhere in here...
...is a "Twinkle".

00:03:33.657 --> 00:03:34.453
- Huh? - Huh?
- Huh?

00:03:47.137 --> 00:03:51.039
Which one of us is the number one player
in our class? Let's face off, Miss Saga!

00:03:51.108 --> 00:03:52.803
Face off? With this?

00:03:55.245 --> 00:03:57.543
It started again.

00:03:58.115 --> 00:04:00.310
So, this is a school for humans?

00:04:00.417 --> 00:04:02.214
Where is a "Twinkle"?

00:04:02.319 --> 00:04:03.286
Huh?

00:04:04.154 --> 00:04:06.123
Huh? Saga... what is she doing?

00:04:06.123 --> 00:04:09.854
This is some sort of sport in the
human world, I think!

00:04:10.127 --> 00:04:11.094
It's weird.

00:04:11.595 --> 00:04:13.859
Shall we help you, Saga?

00:04:14.131 --> 00:04:15.428
- Huh?
- What?

00:04:21.905 --> 00:04:23.236
Hey! What did you come here for?

00:04:23.374 --> 00:04:26.901
There is a "Twinkle" at this school.
Saga, do you know where it is?

00:04:27.111 --> 00:04:31.047
I don't know anything about such a thing.
Just get out here right away!

00:04:31.115 --> 00:04:34.084
Did you say "get out of here"?

00:04:35.619 --> 00:04:39.123
Do you think the match with me is
all fought out?

00:04:39.123 --> 00:04:44.128
What in the world is this one?
I just lost my balance. That's all.

00:04:44.128 --> 00:04:45.129
Whoa!
Now, let's face off!

00:04:45.129 --> 00:04:47.064
What's this one doing to me?
Do you wanna fight?

00:04:47.064 --> 00:04:51.398
Hey! Don't push me!
- Come on. Let's go Salt!
- She can't see you. So, you can't pick a fight.

00:04:51.702 --> 00:04:53.670
Saga, see you later.

00:04:54.104 --> 00:04:55.071
What? Later?

00:04:55.139 --> 00:04:56.766
Did you say "later"?

00:04:57.107 --> 00:05:00.076
Uh, yes. I need to go to the restroom
for a little while.

00:05:00.144 --> 00:05:04.205
Then, it can't be helped. The match will
take place after that.

00:05:05.215 --> 00:05:06.580
Ah! Those kids!

00:05:09.119 --> 00:05:13.613
Come on! Where have they gone?
I have a bad feeling...

00:05:14.124 --> 00:05:18.083
Could it be here? Ah! Could it be here?

00:05:19.129 --> 00:05:21.063
What could this be?

00:05:21.131 --> 00:05:23.065
It's not here, either.

00:05:23.133 --> 00:05:25.101
Hey! Sugar! Pepper!

00:05:26.703 --> 00:05:27.931
How do you like this?

00:05:29.406 --> 00:05:30.737
Did I surprise you?

00:05:31.108 --> 00:05:33.099
Sugar will do it next.
Let me do it. Let me do it.

00:05:38.449 --> 00:05:41.118
Ah! I found Sugar's cavity!

00:05:41.118 --> 00:05:42.085
What?

00:05:52.129 --> 00:05:55.997
It doesn't look like a "Twinkle" is here.
If that's the case...

00:05:56.133 --> 00:05:59.068
Hello, everyone! Don't you know
where a "Twinkle" is?

00:05:59.136 --> 00:06:02.572
If you know, please tell Sugar.
Please, please, please!

00:06:02.639 --> 00:06:04.334
There is no way they can hear you.

00:06:04.508 --> 00:06:05.941
It's not possible, Sugar.

00:06:06.076 --> 00:06:08.445
Now, who has the answer to this problem?
Then, whoever knows where it is,
please raise your hand.

00:06:08.445 --> 00:06:09.776
- Yes - Yes -Yes
- Yes - Yes -Yes

00:06:09.947 --> 00:06:13.884
What? You all know? Where? Where?
Tell me! Please, please, please.

00:06:13.884 --> 00:06:17.911
Where? Where? Where?
Tell me! Tell me! Tell me!

00:06:18.121 --> 00:06:19.110
Waffo!

00:06:27.631 --> 00:06:28.359
Sugar!

00:06:31.134 --> 00:06:32.931
Hmm. She's not here, either.

00:06:33.403 --> 00:06:38.067
Ah! This part was eaten by bugs!
Poor flowers!

00:06:38.842 --> 00:06:41.868
Let's see. I wonder if I should cut
this leaf off...

00:06:42.212 --> 00:06:45.010
- She's weird.
- I wonder what's wrong with her.

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:53.415
What a drag! What was that wind?

00:06:53.557 --> 00:06:55.081
Waffo!

00:06:56.727 --> 00:06:58.695
What are you doing in such a place?

00:06:59.062 --> 00:07:01.929
Finally I found a "Twinkle".

00:07:02.099 --> 00:07:03.066
Here we go!

00:07:03.333 --> 00:07:04.167
- Tah-dah!
- Tah-dah!

00:07:04.167 --> 00:07:06.703
At first sight, I knew it!
This is nothing but the

00:07:06.703 --> 00:07:09.103
human world version of
"Magic Flower", isn't it?

00:07:09.239 --> 00:07:13.710
At least we believe it is somehow related
to a "Twinkle".

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:16.941
Well, now I'm a fully-fledged Snow Fairy.

00:07:17.114 --> 00:07:20.606
Now I can show Saga lots and lots of snow!

00:07:20.684 --> 00:07:22.675
- Well done!
- Isn't it?

00:07:23.186 --> 00:07:26.519
The symbol means "well done".
It's not a "magic flower"!

00:07:26.757 --> 00:07:28.725
What? Then, nothing to do with "Twinkle"?

00:07:28.926 --> 00:07:30.621
It has nothing to do with it!

00:07:30.694 --> 00:07:33.663
That's why I said this was far
from "comfy-warm".

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:36.765
It's not "puffy-fluffy", either.

00:07:37.067 --> 00:07:39.467
It's not "twinkle-twinkle", either.

00:07:40.404 --> 00:07:41.371
So, now!

00:07:41.538 --> 00:07:43.563
What do you think you should do?

00:07:59.222 --> 00:08:00.655
Ah! Miss Saga!

00:08:00.757 --> 00:08:01.951
Uh! Ms. Hanna.

00:08:02.125 --> 00:08:04.059
Wow! You helped me out, Miss Saga?

00:08:04.761 --> 00:08:09.095
Thank you. Could you keep my blooper
a secret from everyone?

00:08:09.466 --> 00:08:12.401
But, how did you collect
all those so quickly?

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:16.339
I can't tell her it wasn't me...

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:29.715
Hah... What an exhausting day today is!

00:08:34.925 --> 00:08:37.894
Huh? Don't tell me...

00:08:38.962 --> 00:08:39.929
Just as I thought...

00:08:40.097 --> 00:08:41.860
Ah, it was delicious!

00:08:42.099 --> 00:08:46.627
There is nothing like Grandma Regina's
homemade lunch!

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:48.105
It was pretty good!

00:08:48.105 --> 00:08:51.141
A "Twinkle" search makes us hungry.

00:08:51.141 --> 00:08:54.508
But, we set aside Saga's share.

00:08:55.112 --> 00:08:57.080
Why are you all here?

00:08:57.581 --> 00:09:00.784
Because we haven't brought our lunch.

00:09:00.784 --> 00:09:03.053
It's not that. This is a school for humans.

00:09:03.053 --> 00:09:05.783
It has nothing to do with
Season Fairies or "Twinkles".

00:09:05.889 --> 00:09:08.255
It DOES have a lot to do with it!
This is where a "Twinkle" is!

00:09:08.392 --> 00:09:10.121
- Nothing!
- It DOES have something!

00:09:10.193 --> 00:09:11.956
- Nothing, because I SAY SO!
- It DOES have something!

00:09:12.162 --> 00:09:13.424
- Nothing, because I SAY SO!
- It DOES have something!

00:09:14.164 --> 00:09:16.564
- Nothing, because I SAY SO!
- It DOES have something!

00:09:16.733 --> 00:09:17.165
I SAY NOTHING!

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:18.869
It DOES have something!

00:09:18.869 --> 00:09:20.769
Be quiet! Just leave me alone!

00:09:21.605 --> 00:09:24.540
That's fine! I'll look for it on my own!
Huh!

00:09:25.542 --> 00:09:27.169
Uh, hey, Sugar!

00:09:28.111 --> 00:09:30.978
Uh... then, please excuse us...

00:09:41.324 --> 00:09:42.518
Eeeeeh to you!

00:09:45.362 --> 00:09:46.096
What is it?

00:09:46.096 --> 00:09:48.030
- Miss Ginger!
- Hello.

00:09:48.131 --> 00:09:51.828
You kids again? Listen.
Let me make this clear.

00:09:52.035 --> 00:09:54.137
Never interrupt me while on duty! Uh...

00:09:54.137 --> 00:09:55.399
I can't believe Saga!

00:09:57.274 --> 00:09:58.764
Come on! Hey, Wait for us!

00:09:59.109 --> 00:10:02.909
Please make wonderful rainfall.
Now, excuse us...

00:10:05.115 --> 00:10:07.015
What a lively bunch of kids!

00:10:11.788 --> 00:10:14.586
Rain? In this weather?

00:10:15.125 --> 00:10:19.061
Oh, no, no! A "Twinkle"? Season Fairies?

00:10:19.129 --> 00:10:21.222
Such things have nothing to do with me!

00:10:21.398 --> 00:10:23.389
Sorry, Saga. We're late.

00:10:24.201 --> 00:10:26.169
Now, let's have lunch. Lunch!

00:10:29.139 --> 00:10:31.073
Hello, Miss Saga.

00:10:32.042 --> 00:10:35.045
Haven't you finished eating yet?

00:10:35.045 --> 00:10:39.744
Since we couldn't decide on the winner
in basketball, we'll face off in soccer!

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:44.913
Today... well... um... it will rain.
So, maybe we shouldn't do it.

00:10:47.057 --> 00:10:48.786
- Rain? - Rain?
- Rain?

00:10:51.828 --> 00:10:56.133
Well, Miss Saga. Why don't you be honest and
say it's because you can't win against me.

00:10:56.133 --> 00:10:59.503
But, instead, you want to cancel because
it will rain.

00:10:59.503 --> 00:11:03.439
Miss Saga, don't you have enough courage
to accept my challenge?

00:11:08.411 --> 00:11:09.537
- Darn it!
- Oh, no!

00:11:14.117 --> 00:11:16.347
Uh... it did rain...

00:11:18.121 --> 00:11:20.487
Well, how did you know it
was going to rain?

00:11:20.724 --> 00:11:24.558
You could be a psychic! Anyway,
it's awesome, Saga!

00:11:25.028 --> 00:11:26.996
It's... It's not that.

00:12:01.164 --> 00:12:04.793
Well, well. Interesting. Interesting.
I see. I see.

00:12:05.135 --> 00:12:08.138
With so many books available,

00:12:08.138 --> 00:12:11.107
I should be able to find
clues for "Twinkles".

00:12:11.575 --> 00:12:13.509
Now. Next page!

00:12:21.251 --> 00:12:25.119
Unless we find the "Twinkle" itself,
it doesn't mean much, though...

00:12:28.859 --> 00:12:34.024
This is a school for humans. It has nothing
to do with "Twinkles" or Season Fairies!

00:12:35.599 --> 00:12:38.124
Hey, Sugar! Are you still in this or not?

00:12:38.835 --> 00:12:39.802
Absolutely yes!

00:12:41.104 --> 00:12:45.108
When she sees the "Twinkle",
maybe Saga would understand.

00:12:45.108 --> 00:12:50.068
Yes! She'll understand! O. K!
I will find one no matter what!

00:12:51.281 --> 00:12:52.649
Hey! Wait up!

00:12:52.649 --> 00:12:54.879
Huh? Please wait for me.

00:13:17.507 --> 00:13:20.635
Atmospheric pressure?
Or temperature difference?

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:21.677
What are you talking about?

00:13:21.912 --> 00:13:25.749
- How did you predict this rain?
- I don't know.

00:13:25.749 --> 00:13:29.515
My invention could use your psychic power.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:33.647
So, let's get started with data collection.
So, what's the weather for tomorrow?

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:34.757
I don't know!

00:13:38.295 --> 00:13:40.195
What don't you understand, Miss Saga?

00:13:40.263 --> 00:13:43.096
No, no! I'm sorry. I'm fine!

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:47.103
Is that so? Then, let's start
from the beginning.

00:13:47.103 --> 00:13:48.070
Yes.

00:14:01.117 --> 00:14:02.285
Uh. I'm so sorry!

00:14:02.285 --> 00:14:06.517
You're no match to me in this, Miss Saga.
Don't worry, Miss Saga. Let's start
from the beginning again.

00:14:07.557 --> 00:14:09.525
Yes, please.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.908
Heave-ho! There!

00:14:27.444 --> 00:14:29.112
Could it be in here?

00:14:29.112 --> 00:14:33.071
We haven't looked in here yet.
So, there's plenty of possibility.

00:14:42.325 --> 00:14:44.452
Are... are you scared, Sugar?

00:14:45.195 --> 00:14:46.526
How can I be?

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:50.666
- But... maybe a little...
- Uh... a little bit...

00:14:51.768 --> 00:14:52.996
It looks like fun.

00:14:53.536 --> 00:14:55.265
- Does it?
- Does it?

00:14:58.174 --> 00:14:59.342
Ah! That!

00:14:59.342 --> 00:15:00.639
A "Twinkle"?

00:15:01.177 --> 00:15:02.144
What? Ah!

00:15:02.412 --> 00:15:03.401
Let me see.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:05.277
- Twinkle!
- Twinkle!

00:15:05.348 --> 00:15:07.077
Waffo!

00:15:09.386 --> 00:15:14.722
- It's mine! Mine! It's mine! I found it first!
- Mine! It's mine! Mine!

00:15:14.824 --> 00:15:16.917
- Ah! There are two of them! Lucky!
- Ah!

00:15:17.127 --> 00:15:18.287
Those are... Don't tell me...

00:15:19.129 --> 00:15:20.096
Waffo!

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:34.110
"Who in the world interrupted my nap?"

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:36.772
That's what the cat is saying.

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:41.216
- Sorry! Sorry!
- We didn't mean to interrupt your nap.

00:15:51.127 --> 00:15:54.130
Hey, Pepper. Do something. Please!

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:58.134
Mr. Cat. Meow, meow, meow, meow,

00:15:58.134 --> 00:16:02.070
meow, meow, meow, meow.
Meow, meow, meow, meow.

00:16:03.106 --> 00:16:05.904
Mr. Cat doesn't want to listen.
What shall I do?

00:16:07.177 --> 00:16:09.145
All right. If that's the case...

00:16:10.947 --> 00:16:12.778
With Sugar's magic...

00:16:33.103 --> 00:16:34.070
Move over, Sugar!

00:16:46.516 --> 00:16:49.485
Oh, dear, Mr. Cat. Bye-bye.

00:16:50.153 --> 00:16:52.781
Are you all right, Sugar? Salt?

00:16:52.989 --> 00:16:54.980
- Yeah. Fine.
- Yeah. Fine.

00:16:55.959 --> 00:16:57.017
Uh, I'm glad.

00:17:05.969 --> 00:17:08.096
It's been the worst day.

00:17:09.105 --> 00:17:10.072
Saga!

00:17:11.107 --> 00:17:12.108
What is it?

00:17:12.108 --> 00:17:13.973
Saga, could you do us a favor?

00:17:15.111 --> 00:17:17.113
We want to hear it. It's been long.

00:17:17.113 --> 00:17:19.513
Do you mind playing the piano?

00:17:19.582 --> 00:17:20.549
What?

00:17:21.117 --> 00:17:26.077
Please. Please. Please. We want to hear
Saga play the piano! Please! Please!

00:17:27.023 --> 00:17:27.955
Sure.

00:17:28.224 --> 00:17:30.488
- Ah, great!
- Ah, great!

00:17:34.397 --> 00:17:39.130
"Twinkles" are nowhere!
Where else is left to look?

00:17:39.736 --> 00:17:45.038
After all, if it were about the school,
asking Miss Saga would be the best.

00:19:11.494 --> 00:19:14.130
Wow! Beautiful! Whoa! Fantastic!

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:16.098
Beautiful! Fantastic!

00:19:16.666 --> 00:19:20.432
- As always, Saga's so good!
- It was wonderful, Saga!

00:19:22.105 --> 00:19:23.072
Saga! Saga! Saga!

00:19:26.909 --> 00:19:31.039
- Amazing how fast her fingers move!
- It was really something!
- Come on Sugar. Stop it!

00:19:31.347 --> 00:19:36.046
You played that all by yourself, right?
I was so moved!

00:19:36.119 --> 00:19:38.781
I was so exhausted earlier, but...

00:19:38.888 --> 00:19:42.483
Now, I'm all perky! It's like magic!

00:19:42.592 --> 00:19:43.616
Um, thank you.

00:19:43.926 --> 00:19:45.894
Don't say "Thank you" to us!

00:19:46.129 --> 00:19:50.190
We need to say thank you for letting us listen
to such beautiful music. Thank you, Saga!

00:19:51.401 --> 00:19:54.029
That was not bad at all, Miss Saga.

00:19:54.237 --> 00:19:58.107
Then next, I, with the number one skills
in class,

00:19:58.107 --> 00:20:02.373
will show you my elegant performance.

00:20:02.478 --> 00:20:04.070
Ah! Look!

00:20:11.654 --> 00:20:13.485
Beautiful!

00:20:20.496 --> 00:20:24.262
What the doves saw here was a rainbow.

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:28.596
It means that a beautiful thing they saw
at school was not a "Twinkle", but...

00:20:28.838 --> 00:20:33.104
Huh? It was a rainbow? Oh, no!

00:20:34.177 --> 00:20:35.872
But, I guess it's all right.

00:20:36.112 --> 00:20:38.774
We were able to see
something this beautiful.

00:20:40.883 --> 00:20:45.121
Everyone, don't you
want to listen to my piano?

00:20:45.121 --> 00:20:49.751
Hello? Hello? Hello?

00:20:52.128 --> 00:20:56.087
See? Now you understand?
Season Fairies are great!

00:20:57.100 --> 00:21:01.969
That rainbow was also created by
a Season Fairy. Isn't it great, Saga? Isn't it?

00:21:02.071 --> 00:21:04.039
But, you're just an apprentice, aren't you?

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:07.075
Come on! I was getting to the best part!

00:21:07.143 --> 00:21:11.011
By the way, you've been running around
all day today.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:13.014
You have to wash your hair!

00:21:13.716 --> 00:21:16.708
- No, no! I don't like shampooing!
- Hey, don't run away!

00:21:16.786 --> 00:21:18.344
No! I'm not washing my hair!

00:21:18.421 --> 00:21:22.357
No! No! No! I don't want to!
Sugar, wait! I'm telling you to wait!
You're not gonna get away!

